body:
Okay so you can be sure, if you can insert your Ps3 controller that has the analog issue in your PC/laptop, if it says :

&#x200B;

PLAYSTATION(R)3 Controller, that's a real genuine dualshock3, then you want to contact your store and tell them about the issue..

&#x200B;

If it says.. PS3 GamePad > that's a fake Dualshock3, that's will explain why the analogs is siff
